<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="Refund Process" name="Refund Process"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2280" pageHeight="3724" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="lane_party" value="Applicant&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-weight:normal;font-size:11px'&gt;Presenter / payer / e-stamp purchaser&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;html=1;startSize=64;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#dae8fc;swimlaneFillColor=#fcfcfc;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="90" width="380" height="3444" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_sro" value="Sub-Registrar&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-weight:normal;font-size:11px'&gt;Registering Officer who levied the fee&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;html=1;startSize=64;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#d5e8d4;swimlaneFillColor=#fcfcfc;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="90" width="340" height="3444" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_sanc" value="Sanctioning Authority&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-weight:normal;font-size:11px'&gt;District Registrar (up to 3 years); Inspector General of Registration (up to 5 years)&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;html=1;startSize=64;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;swimlaneFillColor=#fcfcfc;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="90" width="360" height="3444" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_dcs" value="Deputy Commissioner of Stamps&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-weight:normal;font-size:11px'&gt;District&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;html=1;startSize=64;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffe6cc;swimlaneFillColor=#fcfcfc;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="90" width="420" height="3444" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_sys" value="Kaveri System&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-weight:normal;font-size:11px'&gt;Kaveri Online Services&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;html=1;startSize=64;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8cecc;swimlaneFillColor=#fcfcfc;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="90" width="440" height="3444" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_ext" value="External Systems&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-weight:normal;font-size:11px'&gt;Khajane-II / treasury, e-Stamp system (CRA)&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;html=1;startSize=64;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e1d5e7;swimlaneFillColor=#fcfcfc;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1940" y="90" width="300" height="3444" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style='font-size:20px'&gt;Document Registration — Refund of Fees and Stamp Duty on Withdrawal (v1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:12px'&gt;When the presenter withdraws a document before the order of registration: A. half the registration fee and all the copying fees are refunded on sanction by the District Registrar or the Inspector General of Registration (Rules 193–195, Karnataka Registration Rules); B. the stamp duty is allowed by the Deputy Commissioner of Stamps on a separate application (Chapter V, Karnataka Stamp Act; Rules 31 and 32, e-Stamping Rules)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="10" width="2240" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sec_2" value="&lt;b&gt;A. REGISTRATION FEE AND COPYING FEE REFUND (Rules 193–195)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1f4e79;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="392" y="480" width="640" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sec_11" value="&lt;b&gt;B. STAMP DUTY REFUND (Karnataka Stamp Act, Chapter V; e-Stamping Rules 31, 32)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1f4e79;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="392" y="1920" width="640" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s" value="Start" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="155" y="199" width="70" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prev" value="Document withdrawn before the order of registration&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Previous stage: Presentation, Photo &amp;amp; Thumb Registration Process, section E (Rule 193(i))&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="339" width="260" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_app" value="&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Submit the fee refund application (pre-filled from the withdrawal) with the payer's bank account&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Lodged with the Registering Officer who levied the fee (Rule 195(i))&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="494" width="260" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_calc" value="&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Calculate the refundable amount: half the registration fee and all the copying fees&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Not refunded: delay fine under Sec. 25 (except under Sec. 70); fees for commission, summons, attendance and travel once earned or spent (Rule 193(ii) and note)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1570" y="644" width="300" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_sro" value="&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; Verify the application against the withdrawal entry in the Minute Book and the fee receipts; enter it in the refund register (Form 28) and forward it to the sanctioning authority&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Rules 23(f), 195&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="405" y="804" width="290" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_time" value="&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; Within 3 years of the date of collection?&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Rule 194&lt;/font&gt;" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="969" width="210" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_t5" value="&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; Within 5 years of the date of collection?&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Rule 194&lt;/font&gt;" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="1129" width="210" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_sanc" value="&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; Examine the application and pass the order: sanction the refund, or reject it with reasons&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;District Registrar up to 3 years; Inspector General of Registration up to 5 years (Rule 194)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="1289" width="280" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_ok" value="&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt; Refund sanctioned?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1525" y="1452" width="200" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_bill" value="&lt;b&gt;8.&lt;/b&gt; Generate the refund bill for the sanctioned amount and send it to the treasury for credit to the payer's bank account" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1570" y="1614" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_tr" value="Khajane-II / treasury: credit the refund to the payer's account and confirm" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1990" y="1622" width="200" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_done" value="&lt;b&gt;9.&lt;/b&gt; Update the refund register (Form 28) with the outcome — refunded, rejected or time-barred — and notify the applicant&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Rule 195(ii)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1570" y="1774" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_q" value="&lt;b&gt;10.&lt;/b&gt; Claim a refund of the stamp duty paid for the withdrawn document?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1926" width="220" height="136" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_app" value="&lt;b&gt;11.&lt;/b&gt; Apply to the Deputy Commissioner of Stamps in Form 4 with the original e-stamp certificate and the withdrawn document, given up to be cancelled&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;e-Stamping Rule 31; an authorised person needs the purchaser's notarised authorisation (Form 4)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2084" width="300" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_time" value="&lt;b&gt;12.&lt;/b&gt; Applied within 6 months of the date of the instrument?&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;1 year after first execution if undated (Sec. 48(3))&lt;/font&gt;" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="2241" width="220" height="146" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_rej_t" value="Time-barred: allowance not admissible&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Sec. 48&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="2269" width="170" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_ver" value="&lt;b&gt;13.&lt;/b&gt; Verify: e-stamp certificate genuine and not used or locked; a Sec. 47(c) ground applies (instrument incomplete, failed of its purpose, void or unfit); no legal proceeding started in which it could be given in evidence&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Sec. 47 and proviso; Karnataka Stamp Rules 16, 17&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1095" y="2399" width="300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_es" value="e-Stamp system (CRA): certificate details and status" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1990" y="2422" width="200" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_ok" value="&lt;b&gt;14.&lt;/b&gt; Allowance admissible?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="2572" width="200" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_rej" value="Rejected: order with reasons&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Appeal to the Chief Controlling Revenue Authority within 60 days (Sec. 52(2))&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="2569" width="170" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_cancel" value="&lt;b&gt;15.&lt;/b&gt; Cancel the e-stamp certificate, endorse the cancellation with signature and seal, and lock it in the e-stamp database; allow the duty less 20 paise per rupee&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Sec. 51; e-Stamping Rule 32(1)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1095" y="2724" width="300" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_lock" value="e-Stamp system: certificate cancelled and locked against reuse" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1990" y="2742" width="200" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_pay" value="&lt;b&gt;16.&lt;/b&gt; Pay the refund by treasury cheque in favour of the person in whose name the e-stamp certificate was issued; enter it in the register of cancelled certificates&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#555555'&gt;Monthly report to the Chief Controlling Revenue Authority (e-Stamping Rule 32(2), (3))&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1095" y="2884" width="300" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_tr" value="Treasury: cheque issued to the e-stamp purchaser" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1990" y="2902" width="200" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_sys" value="&lt;b&gt;17.&lt;/b&gt; Record the stamp duty refund against the withdrawn application and notify the applicant" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1580" y="3062" width="280" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_recv" value="&lt;b&gt;18.&lt;/b&gt; Applicant receives the stamp duty refund" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="3222" width="240" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e" value="End" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="155" y="3399" width="70" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e_s_prev_36" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s" target="prev"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_prev_a_app_37" value="Withdrawn" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prev" target="a_app"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_app_a_calc_38" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_app" target="a_calc"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_calc_a_sro_39" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_calc" target="a_sro"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_sro_a_time_40" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_sro" target="a_time"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_time_a_sanc_41" value="Yes — District Registrar" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_time" target="a_sanc"><mxGeometry x="-0.6" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_time_a_t5_42" value="No" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_time" target="a_t5"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_t5_a_sanc_43" value="Yes — Inspector General" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.8;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_t5" target="a_sanc"><mxGeometry x="-0.6" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="984" y="1194"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_t5_a_done_44" value="No — time-barred (Rule 194)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.35;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_t5" target="a_done"><mxGeometry x="-0.8" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1925" y="1194"/><mxPoint x="1925" y="1816"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_sanc_a_ok_45" value="Order" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_sanc" target="a_ok"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_ok_a_bill_46" value="Yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.18;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_ok" target="a_bill"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_ok_a_done_47" value="No — rejected" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.65;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_ok" target="a_done"><mxGeometry x="-0.6" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1900" y="1514"/><mxPoint x="1900" y="1852"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_bill_a_tr_48" value="Refund bill" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;startArrow=block;startFill=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_bill" target="a_tr"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_bill_a_done_49" value="Credited" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_bill" target="a_done"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_a_done_b_q_50" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_done" target="b_q"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_b_q_e_51" value="No" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b_q" target="e"><mxGeometry x="-0.9" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="30" y="1994"/><mxPoint x="30" y="3434"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_b_q_b_app_52" value="Yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b_q" target="b_app"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_b_app_b_time_53" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b_app" target="b_time"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_b_time_b_rej_t_54" value="No" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b_time" target="b_rej_t"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_b_time_b_ver_55" value="Yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogon